cov['verificationNotes'].append('USAJMO 2010–2014 reviewed individually in full. Eight shared USAMO appearances added without duplicate problem entries. USAMO 2013 Q4 / USAJMO 2013 Q6 now has an independently reconstructed proof correcting reversed inequality signs and a missing intermediate square in cached notes. USAJMO 2014 Q6 has a complete coordinate proof supplying the source’s omitted lemma.')
(R/'research/americas-coverage.json').write_text(json.dumps(cov,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
print('New',len(new),'total',len(bank),'papers',len(cov['fullyScreened']))
